        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Walter Van Tilburg Clark, Billie Letts\n- Works: The Watchful Gods and Other Stories, Where the Heart Is\n- Roles: American novelists, short story writers, educators\n\nFacts:\n- Walter Van Tilburg Clark was born on August 3, 1909, and he was an American novelist, short story writer, and educator.\n- The Watchful Gods and Other Stories is a collection of short stories by Walter Van Tilburg Clark that was published in 1950.\n- Billie Letts was born as Billie Dean Letts, née Gipson, on May 30, 1938, and she was an American novelist and educator.\n- Where the Heart Is is a 1995 novel by Billie Letts.\n- Walter Van Tilburg Clark died on November 10, 1971.\n- Billie Letts died on August 2, 2014.",
